     A***************************************************************
     A                                      REF(WREFP)
     A          R PXA01                     TEXT('Extract Ctrl-Agt Comm.')
     A*
     A*--------COMPANY NUMBER -----------------
     A            XACO#     R               COLHDG('CO #')
     A                                      REFFLD(CO#)
     A*--------GROUP NUMBER -------------------
     A            XAFND     R               COLHDG('GRP #')
     A                                      REFFLD(FND)
     A*--------COMMISSION DATE & FLAG ---------
     A            XAEXFL    R               COLHDG('Extract' 'Flag')
     A                                      REFFLD(FLAG)
     A            XAPRDT    R               COLHDG('Process' 'Date'   )
     A                                      TEXT('Commission Process Date')
     A                                      REFFLD(DT)
     A            XAEXDT    R               COLHDG('Extract' 'Date'         )
     A                                      REFFLD(DT)
     A*--------MAINT---------------------------
     A            XAUSER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('MAINT' 'USER')
     A            XAPGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('MAINT' 'PGM')
     A            XATIME    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('TIME' 'MAINT')
     A            XADT      R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('DATE' 'MAINTD')
     A            XAIUSR    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('INITIAL' 'USER')
     A            XAIPGM    R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('INITIAL' 'PGM')
     A            XAITIM    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('INITIAL' 'TIME')
     A            XAIDT     R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('INITIAL' 'DATE')
     A*
     A*------- KEY FIELDS ---------------------
     A*  KEY IS CO#, GROUP AND LAST COMMISSION DATE
     A*
     A          K XACO#
     A          K XAFND
     A          K XAPRDT                    DESCEND
     A*
